<title>USA: Shaw Group units may face strike this week.</title>
<headline>Shaw Group units may face strike this week.</headline>
<dateline>BATON ROUGE, La. 1997-02-03</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Shaw Group Inc said on Monday negotiations with the plumbers and pipefitters union have reached an impasse, and the company believes a strike is possible as early as February 5.</p>
<p>A collective-bargaining agreement expired Dec 31 between Shaw's Sunland Fabricators Inc and National Fabricators Inc subsidiaries, and Local 198 of the Union Association of Journeymen and Apprecetices of the Plumbing and Pipefitting Industry. The agreement had been extended for purposes of negotiations, but Shaw said union members voted down an offer on Saturday and may choose to strike.</p>
</text>
